     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nthis may be interesting for the audience on these groups.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4589...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4589...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a>&gt; on behalf of Francis,Charles (ECCC) &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Charles...@ec.gc.ca</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, March 9, 2023 04:45<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Quantitative biologist position with Canadian Wildlife Service</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div lang=\"EN-CA\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nHi Everybody,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nThe Wildlife Monitoring and Assessment group of the Canadian Wildlife Service is hiring a quantitative biologist, to join our team in Ottawa.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nWe are looking for someone collaborative and with strong quantitative skills who can contribute to the data analysis and survey design aspects of broad-scale (international, national, regional) bird monitoring programs.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nApplications must be submitted online through the following link. Make sure to answer all of the ‘essential experience’ questions to be considered.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<a href=\"https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page1800?toggleLanguage=en&amp;poster=1922275\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page1800?toggleLanguage%3Den%26poster%3D1922275&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449028086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AxYci35CGrEs5nu7lh6iL\">https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page1800?toggleLanguage=en&amp;poster=1922275</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b>The job search closes on March 15,</b> so act fast. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nThe initial position will be a 4-year term, but with a possibility of future extensions. Applications will also be used to create a pool of candidates for similar future opportunities in the Canadian Wildlife Service and Environment Climate Change Canada.\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nThe position is open to persons residing in Canada, as well as Canadian citizens and Permanent residents of Canada living abroad.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span>Dr. Charles M. Francis</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span>Manager, Wildlife Monitoring and Assessment</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span>Canadian Wildlife Service, Environment and Climate Change Canada</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span>National Wildlife Research Centre</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span>Ottawa, Ontario, Canada</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"FR-CA\">E-mail: </span><span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\" lang=\"FR-CA\">Charles...@ec.gc.ca</span></a></span><span>\r\n<span lang=\"FR-CA\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\nC: <a href=\"tel:(613)%20899-6750\" value=\"+16138996750\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(613) 899-6750</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
